SimpliWiki is a tool to create wikis, see also SimpliWikiSlide1 and SimpliWikiPitch.

- go to simpliwiki.com
- enter the name for your wiki
- click "wiki!"
- voilà!

Even more simple:
- go to secret.simpliwiki.com

++ Sure. But what is it?

A wiki is a web site made of pages that the visitors create.

cool!

Wikipedia is the most famous wiki. It is the largest one. Wikimedia too was created using a tool, called "mediawiki". "mediawiki" is a good tool to create large wikis.

For smaller wikis, SimpliWiki is easier to use.

To try it: simpliwiki.com
See also SimpliWiki, HelpSimpliWiki



